# The shared UI packages live on GitHub Packages, not npmjs.
#
# Only the scope mapping is committed. Credentials come from the environment:
#   - locally, from ~/.npmrc (`//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=...`)
#   - in CI, from actions/setup-node's registry-url + NODE_AUTH_TOKEN
#   - in Docker, from a BuildKit secret mounted at /root/.npmrc
#
# Deliberately no _authToken line here: it would override the one in ~/.npmrc
# with an empty value whenever NODE_AUTH_TOKEN is unset.
@6g-dali:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
